# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repository hygiene for the public deployment.
#
# The ML datasets and generated outputs are ~3 GB (individual zips well above
# GitHub's 100 MB file limit), and backend/var/ holds the local SQLite database
# and generated development credentials. None of it may be pushed.
# The ML *source* (ml/*.py, ml/future_risk/, ml/models/) is still tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/ml/data/
/ml/outputs/
/ml/.pytest_cache/
/backend/var/
/backend/.pytest_cache/
/app/build/
/.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
e2e_credentials.txt

